        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='22426' hidden='true' id='9' story-point-id='2' type-v2='text' w='33333' x='65628' y='5699'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This dashboard explores relationships between activity levels, calorie expenditure, sleep patterns, and sedentary behaviour. It also segments users based on activity levels to identify groups that may require different engagement strategies.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='72426' hidden='true' id='10' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='46320' x='4416' y='24816'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Recommendation 1: Re-engage users during low activity periods</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Evidence:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Sunday had the lowest activity levels. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Activity was lowest around 3 AM, with engagement increasing later in the day. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Action:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Bellabeat should use personalized reminders and wellness prompts during low-engagement periods to encourage users to maintain consistent activity habits.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Recommendation 2: Leverage peak activity periods</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Evidence:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Saturday recorded the highest steps and calorie expenditure. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Activity peaked around 6 PM, with strong engagement between 5 PM and 7 PM. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Action:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Bellabeat should schedule challenges, notifications, and motivational messages during peak activity periods when users are most likely to engage.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Recommendation 3: Encourage consistent weekly activity</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Evidence:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Activity levels varied across the week, with a noticeable decline on Sunday. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Action:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Bellabeat should introduce weekly goals, progress tracking, and reminders to help users maintain activity throughout the week. </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='72243' hidden='true' id='11' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='44762' x='51861' y='24632'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Recommendation 1: Use activity achievements to motivate users</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Evidence:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Highly active users burned more calories and showed lower sedentary behaviour compared to less active users.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Action:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Bellabeat should use achievement-based notifications highlighting calories burned, activity milestones, and progress to motivate users to stay active.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Recommendation 2: Target sedentary and moderately active users</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Evidence:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Sedentary users: 20</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Moderately Active users: 21</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Highly Active users: 17</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Most users were not highly active.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Action:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Bellabeat should focus on these users with personalized goals, step challenges, and reminders to gradually increase activity.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Recommendation 3: Reduce sedentary behaviour through reminders</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Evidence:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Users with higher sedentary time recorded fewer daily steps, indicating lower activity levels.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Action:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Bellabeat should introduce inactivity alerts and movement reminders to encourage users to take regular breaks and increase daily movement.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{97956109-4509-4469-8B24-B0A3FE13D7C7}' />
    </dashboard>
